{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "9bd7cfd9fef661cffd1bc4eb7072e97e8c2b03c1cf97066c41638b9165ef5095", "ja": "花盛りの乙女達", "zh": "花样年华的少女们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d06eced23b283fe6dd0c57b3543b36f3108634e1f4947ee868c8467551a2a582", "ja": "クランクアップを迎え、再び麗花の部屋で\n打ち上げ。歌織は勉強になったと言い、\n風花は前向きになるきっかけをもらったと\n話す。莉緒も合流し、大人達の夜は\n更けていく…。", "zh": "拍摄杀青后，众人再次于丽花的房间庆功。\n歌织提及这次学到许多，\n风花则表示获得积极向前迈进的动力。\n随后莉绪也前来参加庆功宴，\n属于成年人们的夜晚渐渐深了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1000_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a33d7ce93dbe1bf4e0ea1670ffcc4542a8733c77ea5e95cbbc5530b25bca795b", "ja": "みなさん、お疲れさまでした！　それでは、無事に\nクランクアップを迎えられたことを祝って……乾杯♪", "zh": "在场的各位，大家都辛苦了！\n那么，庆祝拍摄顺利杀青……干杯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "8b46f2b4bf6d79cbccd2b01bfd4ceed098a548800ac8ddfcc8dc73e510fcc70e", "ja": "それにしてもあのパーティー、ゴージャスだったわね！\n本物のセレブパーティーもあんな感じなのかしら？", "zh": "话说回来，那场派对超级奢华呢！\n不晓得真正的名流派对是否也是那种感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dd2c656cc1d23b02762d0081ddae4fad4fff2e9e499cf613b0c631a5f1b3c15d", "ja": "パーティー衣装も、とってもきらびやかでしたね♪\nセクシーすぎないか、気になりましたけど……。", "zh": "派对服装也非常华丽呢♪\n虽然我有点在意，是不是太性感了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "2add3c8240606889924c331f6288e4af2896e561edaee2edd87a542ac7d64717", "ja": "あ。それで思い出したけど、{$P$}？\n撮影中、風花ちゃんの胸元ばっかり見てなかった？", "zh": "啊，你一说我就想起来了。{$P$}，\n拍摄时你是不是一直盯着风花的胸口看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8190623e3ddfeabe675702d09bbc36f45566b64f51a8b01e69d35cb1874c1909", "ja": "え！？　いやあれは、風花の衣装のサイズが合ってるか\n気になっていただけで、いやらしい意味じゃ……！", "zh": "咦！？不是啦，我纯粹是担心风花的服装尺寸合不合，\n没有什么不正经的想法……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "70f3cffd8d64d1dd190f6c6170010fef08c476f1f82d0db946a1ec7dda010b4c", "ja": "も、もうっ！　{$P$}さんってば、\n本当にエッチなんだから……。", "zh": "讨、讨厌！\n{$P$}先生真的很色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0b04181f558a784f8b5dcc9a938c4a68c86e6fc2da1e5ae243b57b3090629f69", "ja": "だから、違うって！", "zh": "就说不是啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "52a56f981d4e4b17b81bd583718b0fdc9725244eb751d479da19dc1f929fa2a0", "ja": "ふふっ。でも本当に楽しい撮影でした♪　麗花ちゃんの\nアドリブには、いつも驚かされてましたけど……。", "zh": "呵呵。不过拍摄过程真的很开心呢♪\n虽然丽花的即兴演出每次都吓到我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "f7e464a73798d4efe68990663b7d60e01e1d86dbf7736e1e7cd84c26aab04e59", "ja": "おかげで、アドリブにはどう対応すればいいのか、\nとっても勉強になった気がします！", "zh": "但多亏如此，在妥善应对即兴演出方面，\n我感觉学到非常多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "eed557264f5bec2dc2351eb996f87f83e73033ad18adb00b26e3739528843b0b", "ja": "えへへ、歌織さんにほめられちゃいました！　あ、\n{$P$}さんもほめていいんですよ？", "zh": "嘿嘿，歌织夸奖我了！\n啊，{$P$}先生也可以夸奖我喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fba98148d2b9829d9069df896e30c3314834cc90c17f032108ec5e8d66806b79", "ja": "そうだな。このドラマ撮影を一番楽しんでいたのは、\nひょっとしたら麗花かもしれないな。", "zh": "确实是该夸奖你。\n这出电视剧拍得最开心的人，说不定是丽花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "31701c740786b95d02ca5209274744519016e3ef9641380cced38520633bcd0f", "ja": "はい、とっても楽しかったですよ♪\nこんな楽しいお仕事なら、またやりたいなー。", "zh": "没错，我真的非常开心喔♪\n我好想再接这种开心的工作唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "778b45a1988bf355af58733f512e578aa0d6f26eb2326b128242475ac1597c1e", "ja": "今回の撮影は、みんなの良いところ、新しい一面が\nたくさん出せたと思う。改めて、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "我认为这次拍摄展现出许多大家的优点与崭新面貌。\n请让我再郑重说一次，真的辛苦你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aea892286e58ed53c94405c9ce745a61ba2133c1f4bf60209ba78bdbb785707c", "ja": "……ふぅ。楽しくて、つい、飲み過ぎちゃったかも。\n酔い冷ましに、ちょっと外で風にあたってきますね。", "zh": "……呼，我太开心，好像不小心就喝多了。\n我去外面吹个风醒醒酒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "47db06f87fe482526d63388e9f539b7bbbb59b61e5fabcbb7214f6e48220afa9", "ja": "私も、少し顔がほてってしまって……。\n一緒に行きましょう、風花ちゃん。", "zh": "我也是，脸好像有点热……\n我跟你一起去吧，风花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bc59d16387c703747d12ae11d0ebb70476bae9c8cba1a6af626da905c15ce275", "ja": "ふたりだけだと心配ですし、俺もいきますよ。\n暗いから、足元に気をつけて。", "zh": "只有你们两个我有点担心，我也一起去吧。\n天色很暗，你们走路时多注意脚边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fa90736707b71f58b1a548b83ac8a2cfd28f78fb1e2d5567e07b27b032cdc6e3", "ja": "風が……気持ちいいですね。", "zh": "风……吹得真舒服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "e838ed7b79a3ca675ac024cb29c636408a04d7fd20412b8b7fe85fab1bff8c88", "ja": "そうね、ふふっ♪", "zh": "是啊，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "22f673e0be000b9a3095040df775e5fa39c816014a9ef843a5b69742d82e915a", "ja": "（何だか、いつも以上にふたりがセクシーに見える。\n……俺も、少し酔っているのかな？）", "zh": "（总觉得她们两个看起来比平常更性感。\n……我是不是也有点醉了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4b9ede42e50c1fc26bb33d74afbd3567ed44ee8a7d6b99eb30d39ecfef995c4f", "ja": "{$P$}さん。私、今回の\nドラマ撮影で、ちょっと反省したことがあるんです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n这次拍摄电视剧，让我稍微反省了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6802d036b56fc9897dd5ccce0255491936b8b818e7da89d25e0b43b54ab3a57f", "ja": "反省？", "zh": "反省？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a2fe96c645fde047691382f69d259df694bde508d1c9f88f3421ad33ca16c7ec", "ja": "はい。私の役……『楓果』って、不幸体質にもめげず、\n自分を励ましながら前へ進む健気な女の子でしたよね。", "zh": "是的。我演的角色……『枫果』是个不屈服于倒楣体质，\n鼓励自己向前迈进的坚强女孩，你说对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "84adc6364e3c5c5bc3de1adc819e08d55ff36c8bda9f2cda360cc95c0a9561a7", "ja": "楓果を演じてみて、私……セクシーなお仕事を、\n恥ずかしがってばかりじゃ、ダメなのかもって……。", "zh": "饰演枫果后，我在想……\n我也许不能一直羞于做性感的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5fcb628ed9ed823d1b90c5cd1f79af8a8119fa3d575adbb5f563de317a10ef97", "ja": "あっ、正統派に憧れているのは変わらないんですけど！\nでも、前向きになる事も、時には必要かなって……。", "zh": "啊，我还是一样向往正统派偶像喔！\n不过，我在想也许有时候，我还是需要积极一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6e362c343093334f6c6c6b542e1fea28f388a9ae08a0b9b3c2311b8e1fe8319d", "ja": "それに……私には、いつもそばで私を励ましてくれる、\n{$P$}さんがいるし……。", "zh": "而且……我还有{$P$}先生，\n总是在身边鼓励我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "23049a00725d241e2831b064f1ba871d6ee539128ec940fd01dd9e7713c78344", "ja": "風花……そこに気づいてくれたのか！　実はちょうど、\n風花と歌織さんに水着グラビアの話が来ていて……。", "zh": "风花……你察觉到这个道理了吗！其实正好有人来洽询，\n想找风花跟歌织小姐拍摄泳装写真集……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "164aaa420f4b1dd53401dc3c37b20f1ddd73eb2cb2d8b78586f2cdf544ee3c56", "ja": "ええっ！？　ま、また水着ですかぁ！？\nうぅ……。", "zh": "什么！？又、又是泳装吗！？\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b7da883ba68c191c190387e2973c1080c0a307e02b4c5832c8ef637dc8ed4646", "ja": "あっ。でも歌織さんと一緒なら、私……\n歌織さん、一緒に出てくれますか……？", "zh": "啊，但如果是跟歌织一起，我就……\n歌织，你愿意跟我一起拍吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "41d972b611dcf0d080dc3405d4d5c2370d201dd6029b2a794f1d7134eb808e9d", "ja": "わ、私は、風花ちゃんほどセクシーじゃありませんけど\n……お仕事なら、精いっぱい頑張ります！", "zh": "我、我虽然没有风花那么性感，但是……\n既然是工作，我会尽我的全力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "de68d6abb984ff94cdd86df2b07d933fc481285ea8c4bd4739d71f92fff377c8", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　あ、とはいえ本当に無理なら\n何とかしますので、言ってください。風花もだぞ。", "zh": "谢谢你！啊，话虽如此，如果真的没办法接受，\n我会想办法拒绝，所以你尽管直说，风花你也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1030_052kao", "source_sha256": "efa5af378a28895aaeafd9dfb67b3163307ca4d8eab6263b940ac5353b111021", "ja": "はい。……やっぱり、{$P$}さんって\nお優しいですね。ね、風花ちゃん♪", "zh": "好的……{$P$}先生果然很温柔。\n对吧，风花♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f9701d18201fd775fd57b46f889742212331876384a780119d3ac0585eb18ed3", "ja": "ふふ、そうですね。\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "呵呵，是呀。\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "2dac28c15ee918658967387d4c803b308eb6c0dae3bd3adc5d8d0938df57428c", "ja": "あ、3人とも！　莉緒ちゃんが、近くまで来てるって。\n何か、コンビニで買って来てほしいものとかある？", "zh": "啊，你们三个！莉绪说她人已经到附近了，\n你们有想要拜托她在超商买的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "e805d5d739038a894b322d927cf6b3ed70e83132464ae03e7f3d43c06ecf925e", "ja": "そうですか。\nじゃあ、何かおつまみの追加を頼もうかな。", "zh": "这样的话，\n就拜托她再买一些下酒菜来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "7dcdba99760b8527f54d65e3f29465ef2f2e8bbfabca4b2763388f6e7cbaedd7", "ja": "了解♪　フフ、大人の夜は長いもの。\nみんな、たっぷり楽しみましょうね！", "zh": "了解♪呵呵，毕竟成年人的夜晚还很漫长嘛。\n大家要尽情狂欢喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1035_048rei", "source_sha256": "4b7c646d295c97bf77b448b90a3058b77b3fe4c5bc5c700d8ea603aec44b6308", "ja": "このみさん、このみさん♪　こういう時って、\n『今夜は帰さないぞ』って言うんですよね？", "zh": "木实、木实♪\n这种时候就要说『今晚我不会让你回去喔』对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "5812843aae1a1de4f51c4295e374e3fc54d4210a17283705ae8a4f32e7002df2", "ja": "麗花ちゃん……そういう台詞は、女の子が……ううん。\n言っちゃいけないなんて、そんなことないわよね。", "zh": "丽花……那种台词不该由女孩子……不对，\n哪有女孩子不能说的道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "91fa672f5873e2beedec4081ca77914867303f6dc10f2b57568ed5fc4c958041", "ja": "私だって、同じ気持ちだもの。というわけで……\n今夜は帰さないわよ、{$P$}♪", "zh": "因为我也是一样的心情嘛。所以啰……\n今晚我不会让你回去喔，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1038_p", "source_sha256": "7577de3fcea21a5489d4db40748c369e2835d593d9bdd7b4012e005026a7d95e", "ja": "（こうして、夜は更けていき……）", "zh": "（就这样，夜渐渐深了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1039_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dc99c164b13a2e8c3c16a972cbea20af817a834bd12e606c645ad7cf96677d7b", "ja": "あっ……そうだ。みんなの好きなものは、\n共同生活の中で、自然と覚えましたけど……。", "zh": "啊……对了，我在共居生活的期间，\n已经自然而然记住大家的喜好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "72fca66333e3ab2d640790a49a5e40f11ded9b8a09d53f1d8fff5a368aba08d7", "ja": "{$P$}さんの好きなものって、\nなんだったんですか？", "zh": "不过{$P$}先生的喜好，\n是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "fb4447c5449f5187bf988ab37e20d3eb6040a6203729b7ceef5693827ebd7d64", "ja": "そうですね。私も{$P$}さんのこと、\nもっと知りたいと思ってました。", "zh": "也对呢，\n我也想更了解{$P$}先生一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1042_052kao", "source_sha256": "b66c04dd9195159196527f726b80f47d249b580d2e746f9acd8280bc9f0e7c99", "ja": "夜はまだ、これからなんですから。\n私達に、たくさん教えてくださいね♪", "zh": "夜晚才刚开始而已，\n请多告诉我们一些关于你的事吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_07_1043_p", "source_sha256": "46d205498723901e0a04158246889c89487353934e1c37911a9a25bcd56ef5e2", "ja": "（仕事の後の、他愛もない話が続く。こんな風に大人達\nだけでする仕事も、たまには悪くないな！）", "zh": "（工作结束后，大家随意聊个不停。\n偶尔像这样，只有成年人在一起工作也不错！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
